      "title": "Bauhinia Art Meets Bauhinia Science, Pt. 2",
      "abstract": "<p>Following our previous posting on a Bauhinia-inspired art exhibition from Avon Lee, our second update on Bauhinia art covers new and ongoing work from from multi-genre artist, critic and teacher Ellen Pau. This is currently on at the Hong Kong Heritage Discovery Centre in Kowloon Park, and is organised by the Hong Kong Museum of Art while their galleries are being renovated.</p>",
